{"content_hash": "a97986a1125648c6", "version_id": 815, "article_id": 82, "level_code": "en_c1", "lang": "en", "level": 5, "level_label": "C1 高级", "title": "XPeng launches MONA L05 SUV from 139,800 yuan to chase families and Europe", "title_zh": "小鹏 MONA L05 上市，13.98 万元起，瞄准家庭用户和欧洲市场", "has_translation": true, "topic": "tech", "source": "ifanr", "source_url": "https://www.ifanr.com/1686761?utm_source=rss&utm_medium=rss&utm_campaign=", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1720774401213-08da3073d9e2?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8MTB8fG1vbmF8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5MzMyMjkyNnww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Richard Multimedia on Unsplash", "author": "Richard Multimedia", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@rmultimedia?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-crowd-of-people-standing-in-front-of-a-painting-WW4M24Z_yw4?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(286, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(324, 46%, 48%)", "label": "TECH", "seed": "22de88a019f8"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-30", "word_count": 257, "reading_minutes": 1.3, "lead": "XPeng has added a third model to its MONA line, a five-seat SUV priced to undercut rivals. The launch comes as the company scrambles to lift output and pushes its driver-assistance tech into Europe.", "lead_zh": "小鹏为 MONA 系列再添一款车型，这次是一台主打性价比的大五座 SUV。新车上市之际，小鹏正全力提升产能，并把自家的智驾技术推向欧洲。", "preview": "The MONA L05 went on sale with six variants, priced from 139,800 to 171,800 yuan for buyers who order before 24:00 on 15 December 2026, a 5,", "preview_zh": "MONA L05 共推出六款配置，2026 年 12 月 15 日 24 点前下定的用户可享 5000 元优惠，限时权益价为 13.98 万至 17.18 万元。小鹏还附赠前排座椅升级、20 扬声器音响和车漆等免费权益。为避免重蹈 L03 交付混乱的覆辙，董事长何小鹏表示已有 5", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 800, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/82/en_c1.mp3", "duration": 125.575, "size_bytes": 754416, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 314, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/82/en_c1_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 129.05, "size_bytes": 775296, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 314, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/82/en_c1_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/82/en_c1_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 138.15, "size_bytes": 829872, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 314, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/82/en_c1_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/82/en_c1_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 118.0, "size_bytes": 708912, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 314, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/82/en_c1_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/82/en_c1_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 131.325, "size_bytes": 788976, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 314, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/82/en_c1_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@d92c8fa/content/data/versions/815.json", "paragraphs": ["The MONA L05 went on sale with six variants, priced from 139,800 to 171,800 yuan for buyers who order before 24:00 on 15 December 2026, a 5,000-yuan discount included. XPeng is also throwing in free front-seat upgrades, a 20-speaker audio system and paint options. To avoid a repeat of the delivery chaos that followed the L03, chief executive He Xiaopeng said 5,000 cars had already rolled off the line, with handover to begin three days later.", "Billed as an \"AI smart fashion large five-seat SUV\", the L05 measures 4,870mm long with a 2,940mm wheelbase. Inside, a 26.8-inch head-up display replaces the conventional instrument cluster, paired with a 17.3-inch central screen. Twenty-two mounting points, including magnetic roof anchors and threaded sockets, are aimed at younger buyers who film as they travel.", "Yet the real target is families. The front passenger seat offers a zero-gravity mode with 14-point massage, the rear bench reclines through 11 degrees and heats in three stages, and a 102-litre front trunk joins a 702-litre rear one that expands to 1,913 litres. Electric versions deliver 535km to 635km of range; the range-extender variant manages 310km on battery alone and 1,310km combined.", "The L05 is central to XPeng's overseas ambitions. Developed for both left- and right-hand drive, it is earmarked for 82 countries and is due in Europe in early 2027. Higher trims carry two of XPeng's in-house Turing chips, and He noted that 91% of MONA orders are for advanced driver-assistance versions — a figure the company hopes will unsettle Tesla on its home turf."], "paragraphs_zh": ["MONA L05 共推出六款配置，2026 年 12 月 15 日 24 点前下定的用户可享 5000 元优惠，限时权益价为 13.98 万至 17.18 万元。小鹏还附赠前排座椅升级、20 扬声器音响和车漆等免费权益。为避免重蹈 L03 交付混乱的覆辙，董事长何小鹏表示已有 5000 台准现车下线，三天后即开启交付。", "L05 自称“AI 智能时尚大五座 SUV”，车长 4870 毫米，轴距 2940 毫米。车内以 26.8 英寸抬头显示取代传统仪表盘，并搭配 17.3 英寸中控屏。全车设有 22 处拓展接口，包括车顶磁吸点和标准螺纹接口，瞄准喜欢边出行边拍摄的年轻用户。", "但这款车真正的目标其实是家庭用户。副驾配备带 14 点按摩的零重力座椅，后排靠背支持 11 度电动调节和三档加热；102 升前备厢与 702 升后备厢相配合，后排放倒后可扩展至 1913 升。纯电版续航为 535 至 635 公里，增程版纯电续航 310 公里，综合续航 1310 公里。", "L05 是小鹏出海战略的关键一环。该车从左舵和右舵同步开发，计划销往 82 个国家和地区，并定于 2027 年初进入欧洲。高配车型搭载两颗小鹏自研图灵芯片。何小鹏透露，MONA 高阶智驾版订单占比高达 91%，公司希望借此在特斯拉的主场形成挑战。"], "body": "The MONA L05 went on sale with six variants, priced from 139,800 to 171,800 yuan for buyers who order before 24:00 on 15 December 2026, a 5,000-yuan discount included. XPeng is also throwing in free front-seat upgrades, a 20-speaker audio system and paint options. To avoid a repeat of the delivery chaos that followed the L03, chief executive He Xiaopeng said 5,000 cars had already rolled off the line, with handover to begin three days later.\n\nBilled as an \"AI smart fashion large five-seat SUV\", the L05 measures 4,870mm long with a 2,940mm wheelbase. Inside, a 26.8-inch head-up display replaces the conventional instrument cluster, paired with a 17.3-inch central screen. Twenty-two mounting points, including magnetic roof anchors and threaded sockets, are aimed at younger buyers who film as they travel.\n\nYet the real target is families. The front passenger seat offers a zero-gravity mode with 14-point massage, the rear bench reclines through 11 degrees and heats in three stages, and a 102-litre front trunk joins a 702-litre rear one that expands to 1,913 litres. Electric versions deliver 535km to 635km of range; the range-extender variant manages 310km on battery alone and 1,310km combined.\n\nThe L05 is central to XPeng's overseas ambitions. Developed for both left- and right-hand drive, it is earmarked for 82 countries and is due in Europe in early 2027. Higher trims carry two of XPeng's in-house Turing chips, and He noted that 91% of MONA orders are for advanced driver-assistance versions — a figure the company hopes will unsettle Tesla on its home turf.", "body_zh": "MONA L05 共推出六款配置，2026 年 12 月 15 日 24 点前下定的用户可享 5000 元优惠，限时权益价为 13.98 万至 17.18 万元。小鹏还附赠前排座椅升级、20 扬声器音响和车漆等免费权益。为避免重蹈 L03 交付混乱的覆辙，董事长何小鹏表示已有 5000 台准现车下线，三天后即开启交付。\n\nL05 自称“AI 智能时尚大五座 SUV”，车长 4870 毫米，轴距 2940 毫米。车内以 26.8 英寸抬头显示取代传统仪表盘，并搭配 17.3 英寸中控屏。全车设有 22 处拓展接口，包括车顶磁吸点和标准螺纹接口，瞄准喜欢边出行边拍摄的年轻用户。\n\n但这款车真正的目标其实是家庭用户。副驾配备带 14 点按摩的零重力座椅，后排靠背支持 11 度电动调节和三档加热；102 升前备厢与 702 升后备厢相配合，后排放倒后可扩展至 1913 升。纯电版续航为 535 至 635 公里，增程版纯电续航 310 公里，综合续航 1310 公里。\n\nL05 是小鹏出海战略的关键一环。该车从左舵和右舵同步开发，计划销往 82 个国家和地区，并定于 2027 年初进入欧洲。高配车型搭载两颗小鹏自研图灵芯片。何小鹏透露，MONA 高阶智驾版订单占比高达 91%，公司希望借此在特斯拉的主场形成挑战。", "text": "The MONA L05 went on sale with six variants, priced from 139,800 to 171,800 yuan for buyers who order before 24:00 on 15 December 2026, a 5,000-yuan discount included. XPeng is also throwing in free front-seat upgrades, a 20-speaker audio system and paint options. To avoid a repeat of the delivery chaos that followed the L03, chief executive He Xiaopeng said 5,000 cars had already rolled off the line, with handover to begin three days later. Billed as an \"AI smart fashion large five-seat SUV\", the L05 measures 4,870mm long with a 2,940mm wheelbase. Inside, a 26.8-inch head-up display replaces the conventional instrument cluster, paired with a 17.3-inch central screen. Twenty-two mounting points, including magnetic roof anchors and threaded sockets, are aimed at younger buyers who film as they travel. Yet the real target is families. The front passenger seat offers a zero-gravity mode with 14-point massage, the rear bench reclines through 11 degrees and heats in three stages, and a 102-litre front trunk joins a 702-litre rear one that expands to 1,913 litres. Electric versions deliver 535km to 635km of range; the range-extender variant manages 310km on battery alone and 1,310km combined. The L05 is central to XPeng's overseas ambitions. Developed for both left- and right-hand drive, it is earmarked for 82 countries and is due in Europe in early 2027. Higher trims carry two of XPeng's in-house Turing chips, and He noted that 91% of MONA orders are for advanced driver-assistance versions — a figure the company hopes will unsettle Tesla on its home turf.", "vocab": [{"word": "undercut", "pos": "verb", "zh": "以低价抢市场", "note": "常指以更低价格击败竞争对手", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "variant", "pos": "noun", "zh": "车型版本、变体", "note": "汽车语境中指不同配置版本", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "roll off the line", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "下线", "note": "指车辆从生产线完成制造", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "handover", "pos": "noun", "zh": "交付", "note": "指车辆交付给车主", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "billed as", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "被宣传为", "note": "略带中性，暗含宣传口径", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "wheelbase", "pos": "noun", "zh": "轴距", "note": "汽车参数常用词", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "instrument cluster", "pos": "noun", "zh": "仪表盘", "note": "汽车内饰术语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "recline", "pos": "verb", "zh": "（座椅）后仰调节", "note": "常用于座椅靠背", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "range-extender", "pos": "noun", "zh": "增程式", "note": "指用发动机发电、由电机驱动的车型", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "earmark", "pos": "verb", "zh": "指定用于", "note": "常用被动形式 be earmarked for", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "trim", "pos": "noun", "zh": "配置级别", "note": "如高配、低配版本", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "home turf", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "主场、大本营", "note": "比喻竞争对手的优势地盘", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "unsettle", "pos": "verb", "zh": "使不安、撼动", "note": "此处指对竞争对手构成威胁", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "scramble to", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "争相、匆忙去做", "note": "强调紧迫和忙乱", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-10-30T01:15:22.943324", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "The", "s": 0.275, "e": 0.375, "sm": 275, "em": 374, "cs": 0, "ce": 3, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "MONA", "s": 0.375, "e": 0.713, "sm": 375, "em": 712, "cs": 4, "ce": 8, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "L", "s": 0.713, "e": 1.025, "sm": 712, "em": 1024, "cs": 9, "ce": 10, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "05", "s": 1.025, "e": 1.65, "sm": 1024, "em": 1649, "cs": 10, "ce": 12, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "went", "s": 1.65, "e": 1.812, "sm": 1650, "em": 1812, "cs": 13, "ce": 17, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "on", "s": 1.812, "e": 2.013, "sm": 1812, "em": 2012, "cs": 18, "ce": 20, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "sale", "s": 2.013, "e": 2.362, "sm": 2012, "em": 2362, "cs": 21, "ce": 25, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "with", "s": 2.362, "e": 2.537, "sm": 2362, "em": 2537, "cs": 26, "ce": 30, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": "six", "s": 2.538, "e": 2.825, "sm": 2537, "em": 2825, "cs": 31, "ce": 34, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "variants", "s": 2.825, "e": 3.6, "sm": 2825, "em": 3599, "cs": 35, "ce": 43, "si": 0}, {"i": 10, "w": ",", "s": 3.6, "e": 3